    "**Duty of veracity** \u2014 honest reporting, honest disclosure of error and of delay.",
    "**Duty to explain** \u2014 procedure, preparation, timing, and where to collect the report.",
    "**Duty of courtesy and dignity** \u2014 greeting, using the name, screening for privacy, minimal exposure, gentleness.",
    "**Duty of non-discrimination** \u2014 equal service to all.",
    "**Duty of non-abandonment** \u2014 not leaving a procedure or a duty half-done.",
    "**Duty to refer / escalate** \u2014 to a senior, to another laboratory, or to the clinician when the matter is beyond one's role.",
    "**Duty of documentation** \u2014 complete, legible, contemporaneous records.",
